<title>UK: UK's Williams Holdings buys Fyrnetics.</title>
<headline>UK's Williams Holdings buys Fyrnetics.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British fire protection and security products group Williams Holdings Plc said on Monday it had bought the Fyrnetics group of companies from Hong Kong-listed Management Investment and Technology Holdings Ltd for $22.8 million cash.</p>
<p>Williams said it had also assumed bank debt of $2.0 million as of the end of December 1996. Fyrnetics is a fire safety products manufacturer.</p>
</text>
